name: "industrialustry"
displayName: "Industrialustry"
author: "P1avochka"
description: '''Industrialustry is a mod created from scratch, without any prior knowledge of coding or drawing.
As of now, the mod adds:
- 32 blocks; 
- three classes of Tier 1 units;
- 5 "usable" items;
- 1 gas;
- 3 sectors.
The mod is currently in an alpha stage, and the creator is actively honing their coding and spriting skills.
As a result, the gameplay — while limited — is nonetheless enjoyable.
'''
version: "alpha"
minGameVersion: "146"